---
title: Short watch demo
layout: home
shell: frame
---
{{!-- Loaded in an iframe by /collections/video/short/. Clip on the left at
	its real proportion, everything else on the right, one viewport. --}}
{{#with demo.videos.[0]}}
<div class="im-shortwatch">
	<div class="im-shortwatch-stage">
		<div class="im-shortwatch-step">
			<button class="im-btn im-btn-icon" type="button" aria-label="Previous">{{> "icons/chevron-up"}}</button>
			<button class="im-btn im-btn-icon" type="button" aria-label="Next">{{> "icons/chevron-down"}}</button>
		</div>
		<div class="im-shortwatch-player">
			<img src="{{thumb}}" alt="">
			<span class="im-short-bar"><span style="width: 38%"></span></span>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="im-shortwatch-panel">
		<p class="im-snipcard-meta"><span class="im-kind" data-kind="post">{{> "icons/file-text"}}Post</span><span>{{when}}</span><span>{{time}} reel</span></p>
		<h1 class="im-shortwatch-title">{{title}}</h1>
		<div class="im-vidhead-by">
			{{> "components/avatar" src=avatar name=channel}}
			<div><strong>{{channel}}</strong><small>17 Sep 2026 · 3 min read</small></div>
		</div>
		<section class="im-content im-content-flush im-p-0 im-text-sm">
			<p>Sorrento to Amalfi is forty kilometres and takes two hours, because nobody on it wants to arrive. The road was cut into the cliff in the 1840s and has not been widened since; buses fold their mirrors in to pass.</p>
			<p>The reel is the whole road in eight minutes, cut to the bits where the bus does exactly that. The <a href="/collections/travel/trip/">itinerary</a> has what each day cost.</p>
			<h2>What to know before you drive it</h2>
			<ul><li>East to west puts you on the sea side.</li><li>Ten euro an hour is the published parking price; fifteen is the August one.</li><li>The SITA bus is the correct answer after Amalfi.</li></ul>
		</section>
		<dl class="im-widget-facts"><dt>Shot</dt><dd>Amalfi, Nov 2025</dd><dt>Camera</dt><dd><a href="/collections/uses/page/">X100VI</a></dd><dt>Full film</dt><dd><a href="/collections/video/page/">8:12 on the channel</a></dd></dl>
		<p class="im-cluster im-cluster-tight"><span class="im-topic">#amalfi</span><span class="im-topic">#travel</span></p>
		{{> "components/comments" thread=../demo.comments count="318" lean=true limit="1"}}
	</div>
</div>
{{/with}}
